          "What is the adaptive function of behavior?",
          "Cross-cultural comparison, modelling",
          "Contested — framework generative but many specific claims untestable"
        ],
        [
          "Health psychology",
          "How do behavior and health interact?",
          "Longitudinal cohort, intervention RCTs",
          "Moderate — stress-health link robust; specific mechanisms debated"
        ]
